   "en": "§ «And» the mishna also taught that neither man is entitled «to her earnings.» The Gemara explains: «What is the reason» that «the Sages said» that a wife’s «earnings» belong to her husband? «Because she eats» his «food.» In this case «here, since she does not have» rights to his «food, her earnings are not his» either."
